all right i want to talk a little bit  about democratic congressman jamie  raskin jamie raskins a super interesting  guy many of you emailed me when i said  last week who are  interesting candidates on the democratic  side if joe biden were not to run for  reelection many of you wrote in about  jamie raskin and i'm going to talk about  that in a moment but the news with jamie  raskin is that in a recent interview he  says straight up  trump will be held accountable for his  crime wave there will be consequences to  donald trump  for the things that he did  there's a newsweek article about this  which we will look at guilty as sin  jamie raskin promises trump will answer  for crime wave representative jamie  raskin from maryland has labeled former  president donald trump quote guilty as  sin  while vowing that he will get his  comeuppance over the january sixth  attack on the u.s capitol raskin a  member of the house january 6 committee  described trump as a one-man crime wave  during a recent salon interview attorney  general merrick garland filed seditious  conspiracy charges against members of  the far-right oath keepers militia group  raskin noted before suggesting garland  may also choose to eventually bring  criminal charges against the former  president  people were on garland's case about the  fact that there had been no indictments  for seditious conspiracy and then there  was a huge indictment on seditious  conspiracy against the oath keepers  raskin told salons dino bidala and  presumably more to come  they obviously weren't the only group  there  there were overlap there were these  overlapping circles of conspiracy to  knock over the capital and take down our  government and the key moment  trump will get his comeuppance jamie  raskin says i know how maddening and  frustrating it is to people i share the  feeling having been an impeachment  manager he's as guilty as sin he's a  one-man crime wave and it's amazing that  his dad's money and this pack of lawyers  that he travels with have been able to  get him off everything up until  now  um i have to tell you that i of course  hope that jamie raskin is correct  i am very skeptical that jamie raskin is  correct and i don't doubt his intentions  and i don't doubt his commitment to  holding trump accountable for all or  some of the things that he did  but i am extraordinarily skeptical that  trump is going to really face  consequences beyond you know maybe not  having a viable candidacy in 2024 but  the thing i want to bring up with you  now and kind of chat about is  i like jamie raskin  um jamie raskin as a democratic  presidential candidate  is interesting to me and of course i'm  not suggesting joe biden  be primaried although i have no moral  opposition to it although i think strong  primary challenges to a sitting  president are likely to hurt that party  but  you guys know i don't care about the  democratic party in any in any serious  way i care about who are the best people  i think a lot of you guys have convinced  me that jamie raskin is someone that  should be at least thought about as a  potential presidential candidate in the  future a constitutional law professor  by trade  a  progressive activist like an actual  activist um he was an actual member of  the progressive caucus endorsed by the  bernie affiliated pac-hour revolution i  mean that this is a progressive guy by  every uh reasonable uh assessment worked  for the separation of church and state  true separation of churches state and  state worked to ban discrimination on  the basis of sexual orientation and  gender identity  did a great job during donald trump's  second impeachment trial um the i hate  to say it but  i think  one of the issues someone like jamie  raskin comes up against is  not insignificant amounts of  anti-semitism in the united states and  uh i i don't mean just on the right i've  talked before about left-wing  anti-semitism and uh think back to  the year 2000 when joe lieberman  um was al gore's vice presidential  running mate joe lieberman was the  epitome of like the uncontroversial  centrist moderate  uh you know the there was much more  concern about the fact that joe  lieberman wasn't really on the left then  there was that that he was too far on  the left  and the anti-semitism was just  completely off the charts and that was  20 years ago before it was sort of more  okay  to be openly anti-semitic as it is now  in in many cases so i do think raskin  would  come up against that but i think he's an  interesting guy  extremely well spoken i'm not going to  pretend and say he's sort of the  high energy the the the picture of like  high-energy  youth  he's not that but he's quite a bit  younger than joe biden  uh i think a better speaker  more of an actual progressive and a very  very interesting guy and of course i'm  not suggesting anything about the 2024  democratic primary the first question is  just is is joe biden going to run for  reelection i don't think we have an  answer to that yet when the white house  has asked about it they say  joe biden intends to run for re-election  ah it's pretty narrowly worded  i don't know that we can read too much  into it but uh jamie raskin promises  trump will  get his comeuppance i hope he's right i  remain skeptical  even if like me you're not vegan and  you're not vegetarian  eating a more plant-based diet is a  really great thing to do for a number of  different reasons and our sponsor just  egg is the delicious plant-based egg you  can use it anywhere you use traditional  eggs because the taste and texture are  identical but just egg plant-based eggs  have the same amount of protein as  traditional eggs i use it all the time  at home you can make fluffy scrambled  eggs you can make omelets you can make  quiche frittata crepes  fried rice you should see my fried rice  recipe you can really use it anywhere in  baking or anywhere you would use  traditional eggs when i first tried just  egg  i was surprised that a plant-based egg  could both taste and cook  just like traditional eggs you can get  it at the grocery store instacart amazon  go try it eating a more plant-based diet  is a great decision i do it and i'm not  vegan or vegetarian and just egg makes  it that much more easy and delicious

